// Project ANDAM - solar water-level node
// Board : LilyGO T-A7670G R2 (ESP32 + SIMCom A7670G LTE modem)
// Sensor: VL53L0X laser ToF, faces down at the float in the pipe
// Cloud : tech2forms Realtime Database  sensors/{NODE_ID}/reading  (same shape the dashboard reads)
//
// Wiring (see diagram): VL53L0X VIN->3V3, GND->GND, SDA->IO32, SCL->IO18
//                       battery sense IO35 (on board)
//                       ESP32-CAM (optional): CAM U0T -> IO34, IO14 -> 1 kOhm -> CAM U0R,
//                       MOSFET gate IO13 switches the camera's GND (HIGH = camera on), 5 V from the boost module
// Libraries: TinyGSM, ArduinoJson, VL53L0X (Pololu)
// Build with PSRAM enabled (FQBN esp32:esp32:esp32:PSRAM=enabled) - the photo buffers live there.

